&lt;li&gt;EASL Clinical Practice Guidelines on the prevention, diagnosis and treatment of gallstones. &lt;a href=&quot;https://easl.eu/&quot;&gt;https://easl.eu/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;中华消化杂志编委会. 中国慢性胆囊炎、胆囊结石内科诊疗共识意见. &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.cma.org.cn/&quot;&gt;http://www.cma.org.cn/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;UpToDate. Patient education: Gallstones (Beyond the Basics). &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.uptodate.com/&quot;&gt;https://www.uptodate.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
